 your customers react to your custom batches.\n{1610729873749072}\n# Ride around on your skateboard and organize your house and warehouse \ud83c\udfed\n{1410693714288820}\n# Plant seeds and water and harvest cannabis and coca trees. Run the lab to cook meth and process cocaine. Also, upgrade the lab to a warehouse with superior seeds and mixing for higher profits \ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83d\udd2c\n{2128372754728929}\n# Increase your profit margins by extending your product with a variety of chemical additives \ud83e\uddea\n{2141976119716074}\n\n\n{2478301776004449}\n\n\n- Find your Customers by **offering Free Drugs**\n\n- Grab your board and skate seamlessly through the city to meet clients, escape trouble and you can **ride the skateboard in third person view as well as in regular view**\n\n- Dodge cops, Take care of the cartel and protect your stash.\n\n- Manage your finances, upgrade your equipment and scale your underground business into a massive operation and make **One Million Dollars** \ud83d\ude01 ", "short_description": "Ride around on your skateboard, Make schedule I substances in your house,sell and make profits."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.raxsam.info/#privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Raxsam Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://raxsam.info/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_t